# Standard BF translation of bracket records to opaque eight byte offsets
# Input bracket tag with little endian four byte positions
# Output event code one for opening two for closing and eight byte positions
# The first four offset bytes are preserved and the rest are zero
# Input frame footer status is propagated with the closing record
